# Xorg fragment — iGPU primary, dGPU headless (roles/desktop, docs/hardware-gpu.md)
#
# Pins the Intel iGPU (modesetting) as the primary screen. The AMD RX 7600 is left
# to X auto-detection as a secondary GPU device with NO outputs: it has no monitor
# attached, so X never composites on it — it stays reserved for Docker GPU
# containers via /dev/dri + /dev/kfd (see roles/amd_rocm). To hard-exclude the
# dGPU instead, add a second Device section with its BusID (confirm via `lspci`
# at deploy) and Option "Ignore" "true".
Section "Device"
    Identifier "Intel HD 630 (iGPU)"
    Driver     "modesetting"
    BusID      "{{ desktop_igpu_busid }}"
    Option     "PrimaryGPU" "true"
EndSection